F20, 10 of 10: an introduction asked through a named go-between, with no
reason, ended in „კითხვა არ გაიგზავნა". The run had asked the owner why;
the unsent-instruction guard read the line as an ask to a contact, sent the
run back towards ask_contact, and then replaced the reply with the not-sent
line. An introduction line whose reply asks the owner a question is left
alone now, and „გამაცნოს / გაგვაცნოს / introduce us to" read as an
introduction, so ask_contact is refused towards request_introduction.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
